WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.238 --> 00:00:14.599
This is terrible!

2
00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:17.661
Tina: We shouldn’t have left Bello alone!

3
00:00:17.681 --> 00:00:20.202
Danny: We have to chase after him.

4
00:00:20.222 --> 00:00:21.403
Tina: But how?

5
00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:24.124
The evil creatures are flying too fast.

6
00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:29.467
Brad: Maybe something in the house can help us.

7
00:00:33.308 --> 00:00:33.688
Brad: Look.

8
00:00:34.028 --> 00:00:36.089
It’s Bello’s toy car and toy horse.

9
00:00:36.109 --> 00:00:38.350
Danny: How can we use those?

10
00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.771
Tina: If only they were real!

11
00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.192
Danny: That’s it!

12
00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:45.173
They are as real as we can imagine them!

13
00:00:45.193 --> 00:00:48.514
Tina: Do you really think we can make them real?

14
00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.375
Danny: It’s worth a try.

15
00:00:50.875 --> 00:00:52.596
Come on, everybody hold hands.

16
00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:58.358
Danny: Imagine the fastest horse you can and the quickest car in the world.

17
00:00:58.378 --> 00:01:01.520
Brad: Concentrate with all your might!

18
00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:13.637
Tina: We did it!

19
00:01:13.697 --> 00:01:16.619
Danny: Good work, guys!

20
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.081
Okay, who is going to drive?

21
00:01:19.101 --> 00:01:23.084
Brad: Have you seen me play Race Car Challenge on my computer?

22
00:01:23.104 --> 00:01:24.745
Brad: I’m the best!

23
00:01:25.665 --> 00:01:31.569
Tina: I’ve always wanted to ride a horse.

24
00:01:31.589 --> 00:01:33.410
Besides I think she likes me.

25
00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.892
Danny: Okay, you ride.

26
00:01:36.492 --> 00:01:37.393
I’ll go with Brad.

27
00:01:37.413 --> 00:01:52.909
Tina: Now let’s go get Brad: Wait!

28
00:01:53.229 --> 00:01:54.450
Which way did they go?

29
00:01:54.471 --> 00:01:56.792
Danny: They went that way!

30
00:01:56.812 --> 00:01:59.014
Tina: They went that way!

31
00:01:59.034 --> 00:02:02.697
Brad: You two seem a little confused.

32
00:02:03.418 --> 00:02:07.461
Tina: What are you doing?

33
00:02:07.481 --> 00:02:10.424
Brad: I’m using my computer to find Bello.

34
00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:15.237
Brad: When we stood in the backyard, Bello’s shadow [n3@passed right over the chimney.

35
00:02:15.257 --> 00:02:17.478
Brad: That could tell me where they went.

36
00:02:17.498 --> 00:02:22.059
Brad: I’ve got it!

37
00:02:22.539 --> 00:02:23.079
I’ll lead.

38
00:02:23.619 --> 00:02:25.160
Tina, you follow me!

39
00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.041
Danny: Look out!

40
00:02:31.261 --> 00:02:34.222
Brad: Hold on!

41
00:02:34.242 --> 00:02:40.184
Danny: That was close!

42
00:02:45.196 --> 00:02:46.357
Tina: That’s a good girl!

43
00:02:48.938 --> 00:02:52.159
Brad: Here we go!

44
00:02:52.179 --> 00:02:56.181
Tina: You can do it, girl!

45
00:03:05.225 --> 00:03:07.306
Look, we’ve almost caught up to them!

46
00:03:07.326 --> 00:03:09.747
Brad: Keep up with me, Tina.

47
00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:11.708
Just a little faster.

48
00:03:16.464 --> 00:03:16.885
Tina: Come on, girl!

49
00:03:16.905 --> 00:03:18.046
Tina: They’re heading toward the mountain.

50
00:03:18.226 --> 00:03:20.349
Brad: We have to keep up with them.

51
00:03:20.369 --> 00:03:23.934
Danny: Rocks!

52
00:03:24.214 --> 00:03:25.276
Rocks! Stop!
